WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.060
Finally, if you park nose first into a multi-story car park bay while steering your front corner

00:06.060 --> 00:11.880
B along a straight line, your rear corner C traces a classic curve called a tractrix,

00:12.160 --> 00:15.840
proving that wherever you park, geometry is in the driver's seat.

